          "claim": "By [F1], write $\\rho=\\sum_jw_jT_{u_j,u_j}$ in trace norm. For its partial sums $\\rho_N=\\sum_{j\\le N}w_jT_{u_j,u_j}$, [F7] gives $\\|M_{a,r}(\\rho-\\rho_N)M_{a,r}^*\\|_1\\le\\|M_{a,r}\\|\\,\\|\\rho-\\rho_N\\|_1\\,\\|M_{a,r}^*\\|\\to0$. Thus [F4] gives $\\mathcal J_a(\\rho)=\\sum_{r,j}w_jT_{M_{a,r}u_j,M_{a,r}u_j}$ in trace norm; the trace-norm sum is finite since $\\sum_jw_j\\|M_{a,r}u_j\\|^2\\le\\|M_{a,r}\\|^2\\sum_jw_j=\\|M_{a,r}\\|^2$ for each $r$. Trace continuity [F5] and [F3] yield $p_a=\\sum_{r,j}w_j\\|M_{a,r}u_j\\|^2\\ge0$. Cyclicity [F2] gives $p_a=\\sum_r\\operatorname{tr}(\\rho M_{a,r}^*M_{a,r})=\\operatorname{tr}(\\rho E_a)$.",
